Function SetNodeColors()
Title: SetNodeColors
Description: Updates the node colors in the current model to the selected theme colors
Definition: Sys_UseLegacyColors := 0;~
~
FOR m:=#FindObjects(class:Model,Module,Library,LinkLibrary,LinkModule) Do DiagramColor of (m) := Theme_Info[Themes=Diagram_Colors,Theme_Attributes='DiagramColor']; ~
FOR m:=#FindObjects(class:Model,Module,Library,LinkLibrary,LinkModule) Do FontStyle of (m) := Theme_Info[Themes=Diagram_Colors,Theme_Attributes='FontStyle'];~
~
