Function ID_from_title(t: Text)
Title: ID_from_title(t)
Description: Given a title text, it return a potential identifier, i.e. starts with a letter and contains letters and digits, with space or other chars replaced by underscore, truncated at 20 chars.
Definition: t:= TextReplace(t, '[^a-z0-9]', '_', re: True, all: True, caseInsensitive: True);~
IF TextLength(t)>20 THEN t := SelectText(t, 1, 20);~
t
