Function RGB8toA(rgb8: Color)
Title: RGB8toA
Description: Converts rgb8 text to Analytica color~
'rgb(r8,g8,b8)' -> 00xffffff (when output is viewed as Hexadecimal)
Definition: {~
Local rgb := ParseNumber(FindInText("\d{1,3}",rgb8,re:1,return:'S',repeat:1), 'General')/256;~
~
RGBA(rgb[.Repeat=1],rgb[.Repeat=2],rgb[.Repeat=3]);~
}~
~
rgb8
